# quests49/index.dsc - the side quests' index pack (owner: S4;
# docs/design/story/SPEC.md sec.7 S4, story_final.md sec.13b, 14).
#
# ONE side pack for everything the quest log and the HUD read: the 49 old
# quests' titles and hints (TXT_Q<n>_TITLE / _HINT, core/src/story_side.c's
# table), the lines their deliveries, photos and fights say (TXT_SS_<n>),
# and every S100..S217 @mission header (title + hint + trophy). The PS1
# keeps one side pack in its resident window, so a quest log that read
# titles out of a dozen packs would re-read the disc every frame; the
# missions' own scripts live in their chain packs (side_a/, side_b/) and
# load when they start. S5: reopen this pack (`@pack quests kind=side`)
# above each @mission header, as side_a/ does.
#
# The old quests' offers and thank-yous are scripts, re-timed with beat
# codes: q49a.dsc (#0-#24) and q49b.dsc (#25-#48). #9 / #16 / #26 are
# retitled (story_final.md sec.13b) so "Graveyard Shift" stays Breach 5.
@pack quests kind=side

