# ---- what the quests' targets say (story_side.c side_npc / side_resume) -----
string SS_1 "For me?! {.}Oh! {..}Thank you! / Tell them I said so!"
string SS_2 "Tell @T how I feel? {..}Okay. / {.}Okay! {!}Wish me luck!"
string SS_3 "{big}It worked!{/} They're blushing / at each other across the park."
string SS_4 "Not perfect... {..}but they / agreed to have tea. / That's a start!"
string SS_5 "@T asked about me? From / across the river? {..}Well. / Time we talked, I suppose."
string SS_6 "@T's eyes glow red. {..}A voice / that isn't theirs: / {w}Go away, little hero."
string SS_7 "{big}*CLICK!*{/} {.}A perfect shot. / Take it back!"
string SS_8 "Found them! {.}The little / critter wiggles in your / arms. Take them home!"
string SS_9 "{big}Found it!{/} Take it back / to its owner."
string SS_10 "{big}Victory!{/} {.}Go tell them / the good news."
string SS_11 "You'll get them next time. / Catch your breath first."
string SS_12 "@D is cast out! {..}@T is / free. Go tell the good news."
string SS_13 "@T's soul could not be / saved. {..}Their friends / will want to know."
string SS_14 "The demon clings on. / {..}Try again when you're ready."
